# AQG skill roster manifest — the version-controlled baseline for the
# check_fixture_mix.py I6 deletion-guard floor. One skill name per line;
# '#' comments and blank lines are ignored.
#
# It is a SEPARATE committed file (not a live `ls skills/aqg-*`) on purpose: the
# guard checks each listed name still has a dir, so a deletion can't quietly
# vanish. If the check derived its baseline from the live tree it guards, a
# deletion would just shrink both sides and never fire.
#
# Policy (SKILL_AUTHORING_GUIDE §4.4): ADDING a skill needs no edit here (the
# roster grows above the floor and still passes). REMOVING a skill is an
# Owner-approved major change and MUST also delete its line here — that reviewed
# diff is what authorizes lowering the floor. Keep sorted.
aqg-audit-adjudication
aqg-automation-audit
aqg-code-construction
aqg-decision-capture
aqg-evidence-closeout
aqg-memory-hygiene
aqg-multi-review
